<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

<div class="card">

<h3 class="font-bold text-xl">

Is FortisX a bank?

</h3>

<p>

No. Digital asset platforms differ significantly from traditional banks and users should understand those differences before participating.

</p>

<hr class="my-6 border-slate-700">

<h3 class="font-bold text-xl">

Are rewards guaranteed?

</h3>

<p>

No. Estimated rewards depend on network conditions, supported assets, platform policies, and other factors.

</p>

<hr class="my-6 border-slate-700">

<h3 class="font-bold text-xl">

Is there platform risk?

</h3>

<p>

Yes. Like any custodial digital asset platform, users should evaluate custody, operational, legal, liquidity, and market risks.

</p>

<hr class="my-6 border-slate-700">

<h3 class="font-bold text-xl">

Should this report be considered financial advice?

</h3>

<p>

No. This report is intended solely for educational and informational purposes.

</p>

