<h2>Final Assessment</h2>

<div class="card">

<p>

FortisX presents itself as more than a traditional staking platform. Its focus on managed staking, liquidity pools, portfolio allocation, and institutional custody infrastructure differentiates it from many reward-only platforms.

</p>

<p class="mt-6">

Potential users should evaluate the platform based on several factors—not only estimated rewards—but also custody, transparency, supported assets, operational structure, liquidity, and overall risk.

</p>

<p class="mt-6">

As with any digital asset platform, perform your own research, review the latest documentation, and only participate with assets that align with your own financial goals and risk tolerance.

</p>

